Native text input adapter
-------------------------

The text-input adapter also adapts React Native 0.88.1 text/ref synchronization,
platform component descriptors and the UIKit component view. The Meta MIT notice
above applies. Source fingerprints and adaptations are recorded in
upstream/native-text-input.json and packages/native-host/native-input-baseline.json.

